<mxCell id="hints" value="&lt;b&gt;Tiered hints, three per step, in the stage's HINTS (the first two say where to look, never what to do).&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A: Hints (tiers: where to look · what to try · the answer): Dad → the chest → the booking → the dials → the drawer&lt;br&gt;B: postcard → oven → Zaina → Elliot → cushions → trade&lt;br&gt;C: Dad again → the boxes → the cog → the rocket box&lt;br&gt;The list: jumper: the yard rack · toothbrush: the bathroom cup&lt;br&gt;Convergence: everything in → the zip → the front door&lt;br&gt;The Night Moth has no hint: the diary's own feedback line is the only nudge (&quot;five postcards, five years, five first letters&quot;)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="1060" width="1400" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>